            "review_title": "Review at Thuy Mui - Bun Cha Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Upton Z\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBun Cha Very Good\nSep 2022\nWe had to try this restaurant that Obama and Anthony Bourdain went to. Reviews said that this was a tourist trap but the food was actually so good! The pork was cooked really well and the broth was very flavourful. Absolutely delicious!\n\nThe restaurant was efficient so we were seated right away. We were luckily seated right next to the table that Obama and Anthony Bourdain ate at.\n\nHighly recommend you try this if you’re ever in Hanoi.\n\nP.S. Make sure you check your receipt before paying because they almost charged us extra for the wet tissue that they never even provided.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 24, 2022",
